# Purpose
Find past work by starting nearby, then widening only when useful. Explain target
selection, title/body/choice queries, relevance, facets, coverage and continuation.
# Publication boundary
Fresh public rewrite using fictional search terms. No private source excerpts,
paths, deployment details, identity values, or release promises. Product behavior
must be verified against the final search commit before publication.
# Coverage
Link checker and sanitization scan cover this document and catalogue entry.

- Mixed-version field queries require explicit peer support; unsupported peers make coverage partial.

